The original Greeter, NumberStorage and Lock learning examples are retained.
Their existing SPDX notices are preserved; contracts/Lock.sol is marked
UNLICENSED. The root MIT license does not override that existing notice.

Petals and Ethereum documentation are cited as background. No Petals source,
trained model weights or upstream benchmark results are included.

The trained-model benchmark downloads sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
from Hugging Face at a pinned revision. Its model card identifies Apache-2.0.
Weights are not redistributed here; model authorship and training results
remain with the upstream authors. This repository reports its own systems
measurements, not upstream model-quality results.
